---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Debt Funds | Platizio Alternatives" currentPage="products/funds/debt">

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-8">
  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary mb-8 pt-4 flex-wrap">
    <a href="/knowledge/aif" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">AIF Knowledge</a>
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]">chevron_right</span>
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label text-secondary">Cat II AIF</span>
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]">chevron_right</span>
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label text-on-surface">Debt Funds</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <span class="bg-secondary/10 text-secondary text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1">Category II AIF</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light leading-tight text-primary-container mb-4">
      Debt <span class="italic">Funds</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl">
      Delivering predictable, structured fixed-income returns through secured lending and private credit strategies targeting established borrowers across India's mid-market landscape.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Definition -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 md:p-10">
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-6 text-primary-container">Definition & Purpose</h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Debt Funds under Category II AIF primarily invest in debt or debt-like instruments of unlisted companies. Unlike traditional fixed income, these vehicles operate in the private credit market&mdash;extending secured or unsecured loans, subscribing to non-convertible debentures, and participating in structured lending arrangements where bank financing is unavailable or insufficient. They provide investors contractually defined returns insulated from public market volatility.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">account_balance</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Focus</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Fixed Income/Credit</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">shield</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Risk Profile</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Moderate</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">payments</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Min. Investment</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">&#8377;1 Crore</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">schedule</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Tenure</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">3&ndash;5 Years</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Characteristics -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-10 text-primary-container pl-4 border-l-2 border-tertiary-fixed">
      Key <span class="italic">Characteristics</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">lock</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Secured Lending</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Loans are backed by collateral &mdash; real estate, receivables, equipment, or promoter pledges &mdash; providing a defined recovery mechanism in case of borrower default and significantly reducing capital-at-risk for investors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start ml-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary text-surface">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">currency_rupee</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Predictable Returns</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Contractual interest payments and fixed repayment schedules provide cash flow visibility superior to equity investments. Target yields typically range from 14% to 20% IRR depending on credit quality, collateral coverage, and structure complexity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">layers</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Senior/Mezzanine Structures</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Capital can be deployed across the credit stack &mdash; from first-lien senior debt with highest priority in repayment, to mezzanine tranches that offer higher yields in exchange for subordinated security and participation features.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lifecycle -->
  <section class="mb-16 bg-primary-container text-surface p-8 md:p-12 overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-12 text-tertiary-fixed relative z-10">The Debt Fund <span class="italic">Lifecycle</span></h2>
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <div class="absolute left-3 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-secondary"></div>
      <div class="mb-10 pl-10 relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed border-4 border-primary-container"></div>
        <h4 class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary mb-1">Phase 01</h4>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Origination</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-variant opacity-80 leading-relaxed">Proprietary sourcing of credit opportunities through NBFCs, promoters, and corporate channels. Rigorous credit underwriting including borrower financials, collateral valuation, and comprehensive legal documentation review.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-10 pl-10 relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary border-4 border-primary-container"></div>
        <h4 class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary mb-1">Phase 02</h4>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Deployment</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-variant opacity-80 leading-relaxed">Capital disbursed against signed term sheets and security creation. Ongoing loan monitoring, covenant compliance tracking, and early warning systems for credit stress detection throughout the holding period.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pl-10 relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary border-4 border-primary-container"></div>
        <h4 class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary mb-1">Phase 03</h4>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Repayment & Distribution</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-variant opacity-80 leading-relaxed">Scheduled principal repayments and interest distributions to investors. Recycled capital redeployed into new loans during the investment period. Final liquidation and full investor distribution at fund maturity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Benchmarks -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-8 text-primary-container">Institutional <span class="italic">Benchmarks</span></h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 border border-outline-variant/20">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
          <div class="bg-primary-container p-3">
            <span class="text-tertiary-fixed font-headline text-2xl font-bold">E</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-label text-[10px] bg-surface-container-high px-2 py-1 uppercase">Alt. Credit Leader</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">Edelweiss Alternative Credit</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">India's foremost alternative credit platform managing over &#8377;30,000 Cr across real estate credit, corporate credit, and special situations with a deep origination network and structured underwriting framework.</p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-center pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-low">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-secondary uppercase font-label">Key Focus</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold">Real Estate, Corporate, Special Sits</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 border border-outline-variant/20">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
          <div class="bg-secondary p-3">
            <span class="text-surface font-headline text-2xl font-bold">I</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-label text-[10px] bg-surface-container-high px-2 py-1 uppercase">Credit AIF</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">IndiaBulls Credit AIF</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Structured credit fund targeting secured lending to mid-market corporates and real estate developers, offering senior-secured returns with robust covenant protection and first charge security on all underlying assets.</p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-center pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-low">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-secondary uppercase font-label">Key Focus</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold">Mid-Market Corporates, Real Estate</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 text-center border border-outline-variant/10">
    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-4">Access Private Credit Intelligence</h3>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-8">Connect with our credit specialists to review current fund structures, yield expectations, and security packages.</p>
    <a href="/partner" class="inline-block py-4 px-10 bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
      Request Fund Prospectus
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

</BaseLayout>
